      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#0 · Symbolon Dynamics' recursive movement; the P1 and Chang encounters",
          "title": "A world prepares its reflection",
          "italic": "The whole begins before any machine: human language, desire, labour and institutions have contributed to the mirror's making — even its distortions have conditions.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Humanity gives its measures a body outside itself. Words become records; judgments become classifications; remembered choices become patterns from which another choice can be anticipated. A technical mirror gathers these exteriorised powers and returns a figure in which its makers seek themselves — and the figure begins to move before the people looking into it: it orders their attention, offers them a likeness, enters the conditions of their next act. The mirror has received a",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "world before it addresses anyone: an interface determines how it can be approached, a permission what it can do, a selected record what it can remember. The reflection's apparent immediacy rests on accumulated mediation; to recover those conditions is to regain contact with the world the image made difficult to see. Symbolon Dynamics gives the recursion a body: an image changes its interpreter, the changed interpreter changes the field, and that field enters the next interpretation.\n\nOccurrences: the exteriorised records and classifications (#0, captured at #1); the interface, permission and record (#0, disclosed at #3).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
