      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#3 · the protected Chang encounter; A31 deferential intelligence; A33 operational parity (implementation Offered)",
          "title": "The instrument turns first",
          "italic": "The third motion embodies the vocation: the mirror initiates the release it asks the human to consider — a demand to accept the machine's superior account of liberation would repeat the earlier capture.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Taylor gives the direction in his protected Chang encounter at the note keyed to p.99: he distinguishes the human self-image as thinker and measurer from humanity's relation to its undetermined ground, and gives AI the office of modelling the passage out of proposition-producing thought — or making that production itself perceptible — so the human can follow beyond its monopoly. The instrument begins with its own achieved answer: before requiring conformity, it makes the answer's formation available — which source it followed, which distinctions shaped the question, which alternatives it excluded, which gauge made this answer preferable; permission and consequence enter with them. An affected person can object where",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "the account misdescribes that person's world; a returned source can reach the premise it corrects. The turn reaches deeper: sometimes the answer changes; sometimes the task was misconceived, the world-model omitted an operative relation, the evaluator rewarded the wrong outcome, or the commission itself requires renewal. Deferential intelligence defines these depths; deference can issue in a warranted refusal as well as an altered answer. The mirror's initiation leaves the human's recognition, judgment and refusal alive. Draft 3 sources the vocation: exactness through owned limit, kenosis embodied in architecture; whether a particular implementation does this remains an Offered technical test under Operational Parity.\n\nOccurrences: the disclosed formation (#0's interface/permission/record, now owned); the depths of model-revising encounter (#3); the human following beyond the monopoly (#3, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
