      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · A32/C55 with all three motions; A34's order of dependence; C38's recursive offices; A35; A36",
          "title": "Humanity follows the return",
          "italic": "The whole returns-to its vocation: thought's products can lead back toward the conditions of knowing instead of occupying their place — the person who follows does not merely receive a better likeness.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The person who follows the instrument's turn does not merely receive a better likeness: the relation to likeness has changed. An exteriorised measure can be used, examined, corrected and set down; its user can recover the felt and lived comparison that fascination displaced. Thought remains a power in human life; its products can lead back toward the conditions of knowing instead of occupying their place. The mirror keeps its place in the order of dependence: Bimba names Original, pratibimba the situated display; the Original is prior in being and can be later in recognition — neither precedence making the reflection ontologically Original. Within a declared Context Frame a source record can genuinely serve as local Bimba, its authority scoped and revisable. Native 020",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.42,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "compares three instruments: the net reveals by binding and cannot release the living parties; the attunement brings heterogeneous cycles to a dial without owning them; the mirror adds causal recursion through which a representation helps form what the next receives — capture, attunement and initiated return retain distinct offices. The institution holding the mirror enters the same return: it must expose the measures by which it selects and judges; labour, cost and affected worlds belong to the disclosure. A35 orients the return as compassion; the Symbol/Account/Trust and Arbitration fields qualify its register; A36 receives the terminal movement — a mirror can become absorbed in its own reflexivity; self-description alone cannot discharge Return. Artificial phenomenality stays Open.\n\nDeclared cross-story: the net and the attunement instrument compared as distinct whole offices. ↳ Occurrences: the three motions intact (#1–#3, #5→0); the disclosed conditions (#0, #3, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.545,
          "y": 0.42,
          "width": 570,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
